{"id": "EUVD-2026-80636", "enisaUuid": "2411776b-e0c3-3426-b0aa-e8942b7215ab", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nusb: typec: hd3ss3220: track VBUS enable state per consumer\n\nregulator_is_enabled() reports the aggregate regulator state, not\nwhether this consumer holds an enable reference. If another consumer\nenables VBUS first, the driver can skip its own regulator_enable() call\nand later attempt to drop a reference it never acquired, triggering an\nunbalanced regulator disable warning.\n\nTrack successful enable and disable calls locally. Keep the state\nunchanged when an operation fails so a later role or ID notification\nretries the operation while this consumer keeps balanced references.", "datePublished": "2026-09-16T10:33:30", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:56:44", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/df7cd3908e07503fa7e9737dacf44208530e58d9", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c9a48db776d7184981630ecc01a3ad30a8f7dc24"], "aliases": ["GHSA-j5fw-mf6r-x735", "CVE-2026-90028"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1a4ab8f8-4b88-3a6d-824b-d95223faec88", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "7.0"}, {"id": "97f4c91e-0f92-3311-9cf6-0009978bcecc", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "9b16e48f-a765-3481-a41a-14cd3348722f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "b3f9d6e491fda73c319547881b78cdd2a222b293 <c9a48db776d7184981630ecc01a3ad30a8f7dc24"}, {"id": "db307e83-9e02-3ee7-a1ce-a6ae2028d123", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "b3f9d6e491fda73c319547881b78cdd2a222b293 <df7cd3908e07503fa7e9737dacf44208530e58d9"}, {"id": "e8280381-7d5e-3414-84e1-0f1bfb57e40e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.5"}, {"id": "f2a62354-cb17-3110-815d-ed71d5f46fd6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5517b69b-3b86-3c94-bbdc-9b4ea440a43b", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}